tica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">微软 AI CEO 穆斯塔法·苏莱曼大胆预测：18 个月内，AI 将全面自动化白领工作</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">安全研究团队Calif利用AI辅助在5天内实现苹果M5芯片内核提权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">arXiv发布新规打击AI代写论文，违规者最高面临一年禁发处罚</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布Gemini Intelligence套件，安卓生态迈入智能体驱动时代</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/27234ec0b3f822767f2f5a2fd87eb889.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正式面向安卓平台发布Gemini Intelligence高级AI功能套件，标志着安卓生态进入“智能体驱动”阶段。该套件支持跨应用多步骤任务自动化，如自动比价、下单、支付及行程预订，通过AICore框架实现系统级调度。为确保性能与隐私，谷歌设定了严苛的硬件门槛，要求设备具备至少12GB运行内存及骁龙8 Gen4、天玑9400等旗舰级芯片，并需在独立沙箱中执行敏感操作。首批适配机型包括三星Galaxy Z Fold8/Flip8、Galaxy S26系列及Pixel 10系列。此举旨在通过系统级AI能力重构安卓竞争力，但也引发了行业对安卓阵营“智能分层”的担忧。高端机型将获得全自动智能助理体验，而中小品牌因硬件门槛短期内难以跟进，可能加剧市场马太效应。开发者需适配AICore框架，将“可被AI调用”作为新开发</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">百度一季度AI云收入大涨79%，昆仑芯P800交付万卡集群</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6a992a7ad6a664ddd7e7be60b2da4c3f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">百度2026年第一季度财报显示，AI云收入达88亿元，同比大涨79%，其中GPU云收入激增184%。百度智能云已升级为面向大规模智能体应用的全栈AI云，强化Agent Infra与AI Infra协同。市场表现上，百度智能云一季度以25个中标项目、12.48亿元中标金额蝉联行业双料冠军。在算力硬件方面，昆仑芯P800已完成规模化验证并交付多个万卡集群，支撑了文心大模型5.1版本的训练。此外，基于昆仑芯的天池256卡超节点定于6月上市，其吞吐性能提升25%，推理效率提升50%，并已完成对文心、DeepSeek、GLM、MiniMax等主流大模型的适配。此次财报数据凸显了百度在AI基础设施与算力底座的强劲增长，通过全链路协同进一步巩固了其在智能体应用市场的领先地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">微软 AI CEO 穆斯塔法·苏莱曼大胆预测：18 个月内，AI 将全面自动化白领工作</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/f04eb1fa995ceb472bf560be4f035384.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">微软 AI CEO 穆斯塔法·苏莱曼大胆预测：18 个月内，AI 将全面自动化白领工作AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · May 18, 202651近日，微软 AI 首席执行官穆斯塔法·苏莱曼（Mustafa Suleyman）在接受采访时作出惊人预测：AI 将在未来 12 至 18 个月内，在大多数专业任务上达到人类水平表现，从而全面自动化白领办公工作。这一观点迅速引发全球科技界和职场人士的广泛讨论。AI“坐班”时代即将到来苏莱曼指出，那些“坐在电脑前”的工作——包括会计、法律、营销、项目管理等——大部分任务都将被 AI 完全接管。他表示：“我认为我们将在大多数（如果不是全部）专业任务上达到人类水平表现。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">安全研究团队Calif利用AI辅助在5天内实现苹果M5芯片内核提权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/c70cfd19d651983ec4840f1d525d40f1.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">2026年5月14日，安全研究公司Calif发布报告，宣布在搭载M5芯片及macOS 26.4.1的设备上，仅用5天时间实现了从本地用户到root shell的纯数据提权。该攻击链结合了两个内核零日漏洞、侧信道标签碰撞技巧，成功绕过了苹果硬件级内存安全机制MIE（Memory Integrity Extension）。研究过程中，Claude Mythos Preview模型发挥了关键辅助作用，大幅缩短了漏洞分析与利用开发周期。Calif指出，AI已成为安全攻防的核心变量，显著提升了漏洞挖掘效率。苹果已在macOS 26.5更新中修复相关漏洞，并向Calif及Anthropic Research致谢。此次突破表明，即便具备硬件强制校验的内存保护机制，在AI辅助的漏洞组合攻击下仍面临被击穿风险。建议Mac用户立即</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">arXiv发布新规打击AI代写论文，违规者最高面临一年禁发处罚</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/316cce97daeb6e138ca4846876727004.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">学术预印本存储库arXiv近日出台严厉新规，旨在遏制科研论文中滥用AI生成内容及未核查导致的质量下滑。arXiv明确，若论文中存在确凿的AI幻觉内容，或作者暗中植入AI提示词，相关作者将面临一年内不得在该平台发布新论文的惩罚。禁发期满后，作者若想重新投稿，必须先获得信誉良好的同行评审期刊录用，作为学术信用担保。arXiv强调，新规并非全面禁止AI辅助工具，但作者必须对论文所有内容承担全部责任，直接复制粘贴AI生成的错误、偏见或误导性引用均属违规。目前，arXiv正转型为独立非营利组织，以筹集资金应对AI低质量论文泛滥问题。对于被认定违规的作者，平台提供上诉机制，仅在证据确凿时执行封禁，以维护计算机科学与数学等领域的学术传播质量。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
